      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Study context api (imp) -> system ui.\nAbort controller.\nApi naming convenstion.\nAdd polls to the chat ui.\nAdd stickers to the ui (this will be amazing).\nMessage yourself.\nGoogle RCS messages, emoji reactions.\nTelegram emoji single emoji animation.\nSearch in chat ui -> important.\nSend location to the user.\nLink preview in the message.\nPlay the video in the ui.\nSticker Maker in the ui.\nvideo editor in the ui -> simple.\nEmoji reactions.",
